{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10514","headline":"同颜六少府旅宦秋中之作 · 高适","name":"同颜六少府旅宦秋中之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"传君昨夜怅然悲，独坐新斋木落时。\n逸气旧来凌燕雀，高才何得混妍媸。\n迹留黄绶人多叹，心在青云世莫知。\n不是鬼神无正直，从来州县有瑕疵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}